  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="FR">Enfants vuln&#xE9;rables</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="FR">SEMBE II est un accord de coop&#xE9;ration de cinq ans qui vise &#xE0; r&#xE9;duire consid&#xE9;rablement la morbidit&#xE9; et la mortalit&#xE9; li&#xE9;es au paludisme.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The purpose of this activity would be to further the Government of Togo&apos;s commitments to the Convention on the Rights of Persons with Disabilities and the 2030 Sustainable Development Agenda by ensuring the protection and meaningful inclusion of persons with disabilities.</narrative>
  </description>
